{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38937","headline":"和友人寄长林孟明府 · 杜荀鹤","name":"和友人寄长林孟明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲政爲人渐见心，长才聊屈宰长林。\n莫嫌月入无多俸，须喜秋来不废吟。\n寒雨旋疎丛菊艳，晚风时动小松阴。\n讼庭闲寂公书少，留客看山索酒斟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}